"""Renderings of the inferences of T1 in the vocabulary of T2, part 1 (CHEM, ASTR, MECH, HEAT).

For verdicts H, R and X the entry is the translation M(I) of the inference under
the manual; for R the domain or reading in which it holds follows in brackets;
for X the successor's denial follows in brackets.  For verdict U the entry is an
interpretation in Kuhn's sense: what a speaker of T2 who has learned T1 takes
the claim to say, which is not a translation, since some reading in it has no
referent in T2.
"""

